{"seq":18,"slug":"backend-email-delivery","title":"后端邮件发送","stage":"DONE","category":"backend-engineering","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-email-delivery","rating":{"composite":4.23,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":4,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"后端邮件发送\">后端邮件发送</h1><p>邮件是互联网最古老也最顽强的通信协议之一。对后端工程师而言，「发一封邮件」远不止调用一个 API——它背后是 SMTP 握手、DNS 认证链（SPF/DKIM/DMARC）、投递声誉体系、退信反馈循环以及跨国合规框架的交织。2024 年 Google/Yahoo 联合实施的批量发件人新规（5000+/天强制 DMARC + 一键退订）将邮件认证从「最佳实践」升级为「不遵守即拒收」；2025 年 11 月 Gmail 开始 550 永久拒绝，Microsoft 紧随其后。2026 年的邮件系统工程要求每位后端开发者系统性地理解投递链路的每一个环节。</p>\n<p>本 hub 从协议层出发，经过认证机制、架构设计、服务集成、模板渲染、批量发送，深入投递率（声誉预热、退信处理、收件箱优化），最终覆盖运维层面的追踪分析、合规与测试。四章十二篇文档构成一条完整的后端邮件工程学习路径。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐学习路径：</strong> 先读 fundamentals 三篇建立协议与认证基础 → 然后 implementation 三篇掌握工程集成 → 再进 deliverability 三篇理解投递率核心 → 最后 operations 三篇处理可观测性与合规。已有邮件开发经验的读者可直接跳入 deliverability 章节。</p>\n<p><strong>前置知识：</strong> DNS 记录基础（TXT/MX/CNAME）、HTTP API 调用经验、消息队列基本概念。</p>\n<p><strong>与兄弟 hub 的分工：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../backend-webhooks-callbacks/\">backend-webhooks-callbacks</a>：覆盖事件回调的通用模式；本 hub 中 webhook 仅涉及邮件事件（bounce/open/click 回调）</li>\n<li><a href=\"../message-queue-async-patterns/\">message-queue-async-patterns</a>：讲队列的通用设计模式；本 hub 聚焦邮件场景的队列应用（批量发送、速率控制）</li>\n<li><a href=\"../rate-limiting-circuit-breaking/\">rate-limiting-circuit-breaking</a>：通用限流/熔断；本 hub 仅在邮件服务商 API 限流场景中引用相关概念</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fundamentals","title":"邮件发送基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-email-delivery/fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"smtp-protocol-delivery","title":"SMTP 协议与投递流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-email-delivery/fundamentals/smtp-protocol-delivery"},{"seq":2,"slug":"email-authentication-spf-dkim","title":"邮件认证（SPF/DKIM/DMARC）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-email-delivery/fundamentals/email-authentication-spf-dkim"},{"seq":3,"slug":"email-types-architecture","title":"邮件类型与架构设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-email-delivery/fundamentals/email-types-architecture"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"implementation","title":"邮件服务工程实现","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-email-delivery/implementation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"transactional-email-service","title":"事务邮件服务集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-email-delivery/implementation/transactional-email-service"},{"seq":2,"slug":"email-template-rendering","title":"邮件模板与渲染","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-email-delivery/implementation/email-template-rendering"},{"seq":3,"slug":"bulk-sending-queue","title":"批量发送与队列","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-email-delivery/implementation/bulk-sending-queue"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"deliverability","title":"邮件投递率优化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-email-delivery/deliverability","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"reputation-warmup","title":"域名声誉与预热","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-email-delivery/deliverability/reputation-warmup"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bounce-handling-hygiene","title":"退信处理与列表卫生","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-email-delivery/deliverability/bounce-handling-hygiene"},{"seq":3,"slug":"inbox-placement-optimization","title":"收件箱投递优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-email-delivery/deliverability/inbox-placement-optimization"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"邮件运维与合规","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-email-delivery/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"email-analytics-tracking","title":"邮件分析与追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-email-delivery/operations/email-analytics-tracking"},{"seq":2,"slug":"compliance-gdpr-canspam","title":"合规（GDPR/CAN-SPAM）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-email-delivery/operations/compliance-gdpr-canspam"},{"seq":3,"slug":"email-testing-debugging","title":"邮件测试与调试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-email-delivery/operations/email-testing-debugging"}]}]}